OL,3,AIsrael's president tasks opposition
OL,4,Aleader Eisenkot with forming government
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's president says he will task
OL,7,Fopposition leader Gadi Eisenkot with
OL,8,Fforming a new coalition government.
OL,10,FIsaac Herzog has been holding talks
OL,11,Fwith political parties after neither
OL,12,FEisenkot's bloc nor that of Prime
OL,13,FMinister Benjamin Netanyahu secured a
OL,14,Fmajority in Israel's parliament, known
OL,15,Fas the Knesset, following last week's
OL,16,Felection.
OL,18,FEisenkot will now have 28 days to try
OL,19,Fto form a new administration, with a
OL,20,Fpotential 14-day extension.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
